hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"233","Muhammad bin Aziz Al-Ayli told me that Salama bin Rawh told them, on the authority of Aqeel, who is Ibn Khalid, who said: Saeed bin Abd told me Al-Rahman, who is the son of Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri, that his father told him, on the authority of his father, Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “ “Water is only from water.”"
"234","Ahmad bin Abdah told us, he said: Abu Amer told us. H Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak Al-Mukhurami narrated to us, saying: Abu Amir, narrated to us Zuhair, who is the son of Muhammad Al-Tamimi, narrated to us on the authority of Sharik Ibn Abi Nimr, on the authority of Abdul Rahman Ibn Abi Saeed, on the authority of his father, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Water is from water.”"
